<title>PHILIPPINES: Philodrill sells shares in Gotesco Land.</title>
<headline>Philodrill sells shares in Gotesco Land.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil explorer Philodrill Corp said on Friday it has sold its 4.7 billion shares in Goteso Land at an average price of 0.0425 peso, or a total of some 199.75 million pesos.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the funds to finance its other investments and retire part of its debt.</p>
<p>Philodrill did not say who bought the shares. Besides oil exploration, Philodrill also has investments in property.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
